{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ECqugwgEqyZXx2fYjp4ywG","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"template\": \"none\",\n  \"body_chars\": 725,\n  \"has_code_block\": false,\n  \"runnable_example\": false,\n  \"has_traceback\": false,\n  \"mentions_rich_version\": false,\n  \"mentions_platform\": false,\n  \"checkboxes_ticked\": 0,\n  \"checkboxes_unticked\": 0,\n  \"feature_template_unfilled\": false,\n  \"has_hidden_html_comment\": false,\n  \"links\": []\n}\n---\n{\n  \"threshold\": 0.25,\n  \"matches\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Incorrect highlights in printed output\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/Textualize/rich/blob/master/FAQ.md#incorrect-highlights-in-printed-output\",\n      \"score\": 0.045,\n      \"strong\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How do I render console markup in RichHandler?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/Textualize/rich/blob/master/FAQ.md#how-do-i-render-console-markup-in-richhandler\",\n      \"score\": 0.017,\n      \"strong\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Natively inserted ANSI escape sequence characters break alignment of Panel.\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/Textualize/rich/blob/master/FAQ.md#natively-inserted-ansi-escape-sequence-characters-break-alignment-of-panel\",\n      \"score\": 0.014,\n      \"strong\": false\n    }\n  ]\n}\n---\n{\n  \"searched_issues\": 1484,\n  \"quarantined\": 0,\n  \"threshold\": 0.35,\n  \"candidates\": [\n    {\n      \"number\": 3522,\n      \"score\": 0.198,\n      \"title\": \"[REQUEST] Support width-aware number formatting\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"strong\": false,\n      \"excerpt\": \"### Have you checked the issues for a similar suggestions? Yes, but I'm not certain I didn't miss a relevant issue. ### How would you improve Rich? I'd like to improve the rendering for reviewing tables of accounting data at a glance. Numeric amounts are easy to skim (e.g. f